{
  "key": 40580,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnChooseWhichHand",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s your Pokédex coming along?\r",
        "Me? I’m somewhere between fantastic\n",
        "and, uh, hopeless...\r",
        "But this isn’t about me!\n",
        "Let’s battle!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnYouWantTheVsSeeker",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: I see...\n",
        "You want the lucky egg.\r",
        "I’m impressed, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "You know what’s important.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnHaveThisTooThen",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Use it to train.\r",
        "Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, do you also have\n",
        "a Pokétch?\r",
        "Yup, you do.\n",
        "You can have this too, then.\r",
        "You deserve it for all your hard\n",
        "work, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnUseDowsingMachineOften",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: The {STRVAR_1 24, 1, 0} is\n",
        "something you should touch often.\r",
        "It will tell you if there is an item\n",
        "on the ground that you can’t see.\r",
        "I think there’s something here, even.\n",
        "You should try it out.\r",
        "OK, let’s keep working on our\n",
        "Pokédexes.\r",
        "Professor Rowan is counting on us!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasChooseAHand",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s your Pokédex coming along?\r",
        "Me? I’m always doing great!\n",
        "...I wish...\r",
        "But that’s not important.\r",
        "Let’s have a battle!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasYouWantTheVsSeeker",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Oh yeah.\n",
        "You want the lucky egg.\r",
        "Yup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you know what’s\n",
        "important.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasHaveThisTooThen",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Use it to train\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, what about a Pokétch?\n",
        "Do you have one?\r",
        "Yup, you do.\n",
        "You can have this too, then.\r",
        "You deserve it for all of your\n",
        "effort, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasTryTouchingDowsingMachine",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: The {STRVAR_1 24, 1, 0} is...\n",
        "Just try touching it.\r",
        "It’ll alert you if there is an\n",
        "unseeable item on the ground.\r",
        "Try it out now.\n",
        "I think there’s something here.\r",
        "OK, keep working on your Pokédex.\n",
        "Professor Rowan is counting on us!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_Dummy8",
      "garbage": 59
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_ThatSlopesTooSlippery",
      "en_US": [
        "That slope’s too slippery.\n",
        "You’ll need a Bike to get up.\r",
        "You don’t have a Bicycle?\n",
        "There’s a Cycle Shop in Eterna City."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_ChangeGearTakeARun",
      "en_US": [
        "Change to the 4th gear and take a run.\n",
        "That’ll shoot you right up that slope."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SignMtCoronet",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 207\n",
        "Mt. Coronet"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SignOreburghCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 207\n",
        "Oreburgh City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_TrainerTipsImmobilizedIfAsleepOrParalyzed",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Pokémon may become immobilized if\n",
        "they are asleep or paralyzed.\r",
        "If it happens to your Pokémon,\n",
        "it could be disastrous.\r",
        "If your opponent’s Pokémon can’t\n",
        "move, it’s a big opportunity!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_14",
      "en_US": [
        "I have seen a young girl going\n",
        "into Wayward Cave, north of here\r",
        "below the cycling road.She hasn’t\n",
        "came back yet! Would you please\r",
        "go look for her? I will give you\n",
        "my collection of evolution stones!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_15",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh you found her! As promised\n",
        "you can have these!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_16",
      "en_US": "I’m glad you helped her!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_17",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: I’ve got something nice for you.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, choose which hand\r",
        "you want."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_18",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Lately, I’ve been experimenting\n",
        "with a couple of neat tools.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I’ll share with you.\n",
        "Choose a hand!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_19",
      "en_US": "You can’t teleport from here for now...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_20",
      "en_US": "Where do you want to be teleported to?"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_21",
      "en_US": "Mt. Coronet exterior 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_22",
      "en_US": "Mt. Coronet exterior 2"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_23",
      "en_US": "Spear Pillar entrance"
    }
  ]
}
